        <mxCell id="c187" value="&lt;i&gt;Report view, page Ex 16.3, with the Year filter on the 3 years of the window, so the axis ends in 2026-12 and not in the empty months of the Date table. A month with no surge day has no column and leaves a gap in the line. The first surge day is 2024-05-31, the only one of 2024-05; the outlined month, 2026-10, has the most, 7. The table shows Desktop&#x27;s total row; the page&#x27;s text box is not drawn.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="568" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
